<title>UK: IADB sets NZ$100 million one-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>IADB sets NZ$100 million one-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Toronto-Dominion.</p>
<p> BORROWER   INTER-AMERICAN DEVELOPMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT     NZ$100 MLN   COUPON     8.50	MATURITY    26.SEP.97</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.905   PAY DATE    25.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.125     LISTING    LUX</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  0.875</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
